-- load-bearing: a database seeded locally already holds this config under a
-- random uuid, so statement 1 skipped and a hard-coded configId here would
-- fail the foreign key. Joining by label attaches the bands to whichever
-- row actually carries the 2022 barème, new or pre-existing.

